{"id":"05c7f9f21bb85660","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality.md","title":"透明域上的证明外延性","display":"lem-truth-predicate-extensionality — 透明域上的证明外延性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality","aliases":["91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality","91-lem-T-extensionality","91-lem-truth-extensional"],"display":"lem-truth-predicate-extensionality — 透明域上的证明外延性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-transparency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality</span><span>91-lem-T-extensionality</span><span>91-lem-truth-extensional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-truth-predicate-extensionality — 透明域上的证明外延性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b04a030dde171267\" href=\"?note=b04a030dde171267\" title=\"91-df-transparency\">91-df-transparency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (含真理谓词的背景理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}\\)</span> (指定的透明句子域)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\\)</span>\n(域上透明性, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b04a030dde171267\" href=\"?note=b04a030dde171267\" title=\"91-df-transparency\">91-df-transparency</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}extensionality}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}extensionality}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>右侧性质记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\)</span>，分别用透明双条件把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>、把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 联系，再与给定的\n证明等价合成。</p>\n<p>结论只覆盖理论能证明透明性的域。TB 的域是基础闭句；UTB 统一覆盖\n基础公式的数码实例。裸 KF 并不对任意自指句满足全透明 T-schema，\n所以不能把该引理无条件提升为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 上的全局外延性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-transparency","status":"resolved","id":"b04a030dde171267","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-transparency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-transparency","status":"resolved","id":"b04a030dde171267","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)$\n(域上透明性, see [[91-df-transparency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}extensionality}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":1598,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-truth-predicate-extensionality]]"}],"outgoing":["0838e653809dc677","b04a030dde171267"]}